---
import "../../public/css/testimonials-section.css";
---

<section id="testimonials" class="testimonials-section-modern">
  <!-- Fondo con efectos -->
  <div class="testimonials-bg-modern">
    <div class="testimonials-gradient-overlay"></div>

    <div class="testimonials-floating-elements">
      <div class="testimonials-element testimonials-element-1"></div>
      <div class="testimonials-element testimonials-element-2"></div>
      <div class="testimonials-element testimonials-element-3"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Encabezado -->
    <div class="testimonials-header-modern text-center">
      <div class="testimonials-badge" data-aos="fade-down">
        <i class="bi bi-chat-quote"></i>
        <span>Experiencias Reales</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="testimonials-title" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        Lo que dicen nuestros <span class="testimonials-gradient">clientes</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="testimonials-subtitle" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        Conocé las experiencias reales de empresas que confiaron en nosotros para transformar su negocio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid de testimonios -->
    <div class="testimonials-grid-modern">
      <!-- Testimonio 1 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card-modern" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="testimonial-inner">
          <div class="quote-icon"><i class="bi bi-quote"></i></div>
          
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <p class="testimonial-text">
              "Gracias a <strong>Imperial Net</strong> pudimos automatizar todas nuestras tareas críticas.
              El sistema que desarrollaron transformó completamente nuestra operación. Ahora nuestro equipo
              se concentra en hacer crecer el negocio en lugar de resolver problemas técnicos constantemente."
            </p>
            <div class="testimonial-rating">
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-author">
            <div class="author-avatar">
              <img src="/img/logos/coblan.webp" alt="Federico Blanco - Director de Coblan" />
              <div class="avatar-glow"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="author-info">
              <h4 class="author-name">Federico Blanco</h4>
              <p class="author-company">Coblan</p>
              <p class="author-position">Gerente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonio 2 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card-modern" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="testimonial-inner">
          <div class="quote-icon"><i class="bi bi-quote"></i></div>
          
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <p class="testimonial-text">
              "El equipo de <strong>Imperial Net</strong> entendió exactamente lo que necesitábamos desde el primer día.
              La solución que desarrollaron no solo es extremadamente funcional, sino que también es
              intuitiva y totalmente accesible para todo nuestro staff."
            </p>
            <div class="testimonial-rating">
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-author">
            <div class="author-avatar">
              <img src="/img/logos/imparable.webp" alt="Ezequiel Cabrera - Director de Imparable" />
              <div class="avatar-glow"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="author-info">
              <h4 class="author-name">Ezequiel Cabrera</h4>
              <p class="author-company">Imparable Gym</p>
              <p class="author-position">Director</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonio 3 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card-modern" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <div class="testimonial-inner">
          <div class="quote-icon"><i class="bi bi-quote"></i></div>
          
          <div class="testimonial-content">
            <p class="testimonial-text">
              "La experiencia trabajando con <strong>Imperial Net</strong> fue excepcional de principio a fin.
              Gracias a su trabajo profesional logramos potenciar significativamente nuestra presencia en el mercado,
              llegar a muchos más clientes y hacer crecer nuestro negocio de manera sostenible."
            </p>
            <div class="testimonial-rating">
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
              <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="testimonial-author">
            <div class="author-avatar">
              <img src="/img/logos/sol-fotofashion.webp" alt="Sol Schmidt - Directora de Sol Fotofashion" />
              <div class="avatar-glow"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="author-info">
              <h4 class="author-name">Sol Schmidt</h4>
              <p class="author-company">Sol Fotofashion</p>
              <p class="author-position">Propietaria</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Estadísticas globales -->
    <div class="testimonials-stats-modern" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
      <div class="stats-container">
        <div class="stat-item-testimonials">
          <span class="stat-number-testimonials">100%</span>
          <span class="stat-label-testimonials">Clientes Satisfechos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item-testimonials">
          <span class="stat-number-testimonials">50+</span>
          <span class="stat-label-testimonials">Proyectos Exitosos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item-testimonials">
          <span class="stat-number-testimonials">5★</span>
          <span class="stat-label-testimonials">Calificación Promedio</span>
        </div>
      
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Sección principal */
  .testimonials-section-modern {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Fondo con efectos */
  .testimonials-bg-modern {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .testimonials-gradient-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.1) 0%, rgba(0, 198, 255, 0.05) 100%);
  }

  .testimonials-floating-elements {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .testimonials-element {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.1), rgba(0, 198, 255, 0.05));
    animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .testimonials-element-1 {
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    top: 10%;
    left: -10%;
    animation-delay: 0s;
  }

  .testimonials-element-2 {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    top: 60%;
    right: -5%;
    animation-delay: 2s;
  }

  .testimonials-element-3 {
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    top: 80%;
    left: 20%;
    animation-delay: 4s;
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(180deg); }
  }

  /* Container principal */
  .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Header */
  .testimonials-header-modern {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .testimonials-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: 50px;
    color: #007bff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .testimonials-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .testimonials-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #00c6ff);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .testimonials-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Grid de testimonios */
  .testimonials-grid-modern {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  /* Tarjetas de testimonio */
  .testimonial-card-modern {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
    height: auto;
    min-height: 320px;
  }

  .testimonial-card-modern::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.1) 0%, rgba(0, 198, 255, 0.05) 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
  }

  .testimonial-card-modern:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .testimonial-card-modern:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .testimonial-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .quote-icon {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #00c6ff);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: absolute;
    top: -5px;
    right: 20px;
    z-index: 3;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .quote-icon i {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: white;
  }

  /* Contenido del testimonio */
  .testimonial-content {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .testimonial-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .testimonial-text strong {
    color: #1f3146;
  }

  .testimonial-rating {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    color: #ffc107;
    font-size: 18px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Información del autor */
  .testimonial-author {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .author-avatar {
    position: relative;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
  }

  .author-avatar img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid #007bff;
  }

  .avatar-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -2px;
    left: -2px;
    width: calc(100% + 4px);
    height: calc(100% + 4px);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #00c6ff);
    z-index: -1;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }
  }

  .author-info h4 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .author-info p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .author-company {
    color: #0b0246 !important;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  /* Estadísticas globales */
  .testimonials-stats-modern {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stats-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .stat-item-testimonials {
    padding: 30px 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .stat-item-testimonials:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .stat-number-testimonials {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #00c6ff);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .stat-label-testimonials {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .testimonials-section-modern {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }
    
    .testimonials-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    
    .testimonials-grid-modern {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }
    
    .testimonial-card-modern {
      padding: 30px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .testimonials-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    
    .testimonials-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    
    .testimonial-card-modern {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    
    .stats-container {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .stats-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .stat-number-testimonials {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
